<title>FRANCE: Suez first half net profit 772 mln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Suez first half net profit 772 mln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net Profit			     772	vs  loss   3,976</p>
<p>    Exceptional profit		   381	vs  loss     810</p>
<p>    Property charge			795	vs  charge 4,076</p>
<p>    Pre tax, pre exceptional profit 1,186	vs  profit  910</p>
<p>NOTE - Cie de Suez gave its results in a statement. It said results included Banque Indosuez. The final price for the sale of the bank, agreed earlier this year, will be decided later and therefore that price was not included in Suez's half-year results, nor in asset sales, nor in the contribution of Banque Indosuez to overall results.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
